# Default-deny build context: only immutable worker code, public corpus, and
# pinned OCI policy assets enter an image layer. Private corpus, credentials,
# host configuration, and run artifacts never enter the image.
*
!Dockerfile.worker
!.dockerignore
!requirements.worker.lock
!uv.lock
!wheelhouse/
!wheelhouse/**
!oci/
!oci/**
!corpus/
!corpus/public/
!corpus/public/**
!src/
!src/**
!protocol/
!protocol/ultimateinterview/
!protocol/ultimateinterview/ui-native-77b0327-r4/
!protocol/ultimateinterview/ui-native-77b0327-r4/**
